<p>With co-founder Nick Phillips, The Designers Republic (TDR) quickly became synonymous with music, designing record covers, packaging, logos and campaigns for everyone from Aphex Twin to Autechre, Pulp to Nine Inch Nails. They worked on groundbreaking video games, such as Wipeout and Grand Theft Auto, collaborated with brand behemoths like Coca-Cola and Adidas, and their work is held in the MoMA and the V&amp;A. There exist such obsessive collectors of their work that Anderson cites one person who remortaged his house twice to keep up with their output.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/jul/23/sheffield-designers-republic-aphex-twin-pulp-pringles-ian-anderson">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;LZzac1-JfJ2qYCnByVYS8OhySyEPFOC-NmmgUONx8Jgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;ex7avSmf4_VY3RtUMt53j5QSjciB2EbDnWbH8OXJ5iMƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jXi94ojIOgSLSlB-7-hFlHPJnuwO_7-PeHYc8xy9ODQƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;MRyWzzAhYeTTyCAarvzYqzck-mtyV2JecBxkO02qz58ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zOxDf5lx4QQafUINZsHgDQPRaUOE2f93zzUPfjQL3Dsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QT9ekscuKYfDFoylaoA0PJBSnmLrzM_a4oUMqkwXnxgƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QphijWA9Y3WvV3ET5VRfcmS8aBJl-S9_WqEE2DyFYY8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;UZLTVIkwkuJ8cc3zACl