he V&amp;A. There exist such obsessive collectors of their work that Anderson cites one person who remortaged his house twice to keep up with their output.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/jul/23/sheffield-designers-republic-aphex-twin-pulp-pringles-ian-anderson">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WL0y_N8ueTVdFd2iAsqiL5Ng-Bj6TPcarqV_AfHxX4Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxƒâ€˜We didnâ€™t care what the client wanted!â€™: Sheffieldâ€™s Designers Republic on their art for Aphex Twin, Pulp â€¦ and Pringlesƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;wdkG5qeFGynLFtv4RplM_RmHtZ0p2i2tYaStcGw8sekƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;tzYsb060c7oBnHfa6HvAH8ZYHmDTLYDWMj36IQF3_CMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxwhttps://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/jul/23/sheffield-designers-republic-aphex-twin-pulp-pringles-ian-andersonƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;_Q5rVGjOjbmCsiT_vz_jUTiS37sFHWNVb0Vv9FKJP7Mƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx`we-didn-t-care-what-the-client-wanted-sheffield-s-designers-republic-on-their-art-for-aphex-twinƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;l0G4cTR8k7DmHxOvaephiKaODBQOOATfK9hQRsteSy4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;OUAYV0AcHDqiLbSObgQzfBvnaDkfuXnoLC_oyTDaHJIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcultureƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jkQYAUOoDEZgEn6Ht0HeEGtThlaWOtyUi5ug20x8hSgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒeri